("Realtor.com puts the school-district premium at 49%; Redfin at $50 per square foot, about $100,000 for 2,000 sq ft.","Redfin calls it $50 extra per","Consistent by analyst recall with 2016 Realtor.com and Redfin analyses; K02: 50 x 2,000 = $100,000 reproduces. Dates not stated.",[]),
